  IF DUP TypeName "list" == THEN IF DUP Size 2 == THEN Explode Drop ELSE IF DUP Size 3 == THEN Explode Drop Drop ELSE "LogisSx: needs 2 arguments" DoError END END END
  → μv sv « μv 0 + sv 0 + → μ s « 's*Ⓒπ/√(3)' →Num μv sv 2 →List Drop » »
